  {
   "id": "matematicas-2018-septiembre-3",
   "n": 3,
   "num": 3,
   "bloque": "Opción A",
   "puntos": "2,5",
   "enunciado": {
    "intro": "Considera las siguientes matrices \\(A=\\begin{pmatrix}0&0&1\\\\0&-1&0\\\\1&0&0\\end{pmatrix}\\) y \\(B=\\begin{pmatrix}a&b&c\\\\0&1&0\\\\-1&0&0\\end{pmatrix}\\).",
    "apartados": [
     "(0,75 p.) Determina, si existen, los valores de \\(a\\), \\(b\\) y \\(c\\) para los que las matrices \\(A\\) y \\(B\\) conmutan.",
     "(1 p.) Calcula \\(A^2\\), \\(A^3\\), \\(A^{2017}\\) y \\(A^{2018}\\).",
     "(0,75 p.) Calcula, si existe, la matriz inversa de \\(A\\)."
    ]
   },
   "solucion": [
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado a",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>\\(A\\) y \\(B\\) conmutan si \\(AB=BA\\):</p>\\[AB=\\begin{pmatrix}0&0&1\\\\0&-1&0\\\\1&0&0\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}a&b&c\\\\0&1&0\\\\-1&0&0\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}-1&0&0\\\\0&-1&0\\\\a&b&c\\end{pmatrix}\\]\\[BA=\\begin{pmatrix}a&b&c\\\\0&1&0\\\\-1&0&0\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}0&0&1\\\\0&-1&0\\\\1&0&0\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}c&- b&a\\\\0&-1&0\\\\0&0&-1\\end{pmatrix}\\]<p>Igualando elemento a elemento: \\(c=-1\\), \\(-b=0\\), \\(a=0\\), y en la tercera fila \\(a=0\\), \\(b=0\\), \\(c=-1\\). Todas las condiciones son compatibles.</p><div class='res'>\\(a=0,\\ b=0,\\ c=-1\\)</div></div>"
    },
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado b",
     "html": "<div class='ex'>\\[A^2=\\begin{pmatrix}0&0&1\\\\0&-1&0\\\\1&0&0\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}0&0&1\\\\0&-1&0\\\\1&0&0\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}1&0&0\\\\0&1&0\\\\0&0&1\\end{pmatrix}=I\\]\\[A^3=A^2A=IA=A\\]<p>Las potencias se repiten: las pares valen \\(I\\) y las impares valen \\(A\\)<i class='n' data-t='why'>\\(A^{2k}=(A^2)^k=I^k=I\\) y \\(A^{2k+1}=A^{2k}A=A\\).</i>. Como 2017 es impar y 2018 es par:</p><div class='res'>\\(A^2=I,\\ A^3=A,\\ A^{2017}=A,\\ A^{2018}=I\\)</div></div>"
    },
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado c",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>\\(A\\) tiene inversa si y solo si \\(|A|\\neq0\\). Lo calculo por la regla de Sarrus<i class='n' data-t='th'>Regla de Sarrus: se suman los productos de la diagonal principal y de los dos triángulos con un lado paralelo a ella (en verde) y se restan los de la diagonal secundaria y sus dos triángulos (en rojo).<span style='display:block;margin:6px 0 0'><svg viewBox='0 0 206 106' width='100%' style='max-width:230px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif'><text x='0' y='30' font-size='20' font-weight='700' fill='#17a673'>+</text><text x='0' y='86' font-size='20' font-weight='700' fill='#e8487a'>−</text><polygon points='26,10 41,25 56,40' fill='#17a673' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='26' cy='10' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='41' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='26' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='25' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='56' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='26' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='40' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><polygon points='103,10 118,25 88,40' fill='#17a673' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='88' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='10' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='118' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='88' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='25' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='88' cy='40' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='103' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='180,10 150,25 165,40' fill='#17a673' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='150' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='10' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='150' cy='25' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='165' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='150' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='40' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='180' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='56,66 41,81 26,96' fill='#e8487a' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='26' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='66' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='26' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='81' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='56' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='26' cy='96' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='41' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='88,66 118,81 103,96' fill='#e8487a' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='88' cy='66' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='103' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='88' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='81' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='88' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='96' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='118' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='165,66 150,81 180,96' fill='#e8487a' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='150' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='66' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='180' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='150' cy='81' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='165' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='150' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='96' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/></svg></span></i>:</p>\\[|A|=\\begin{vmatrix}0&0&1\\\\0&-1&0\\\\1&0&0\\end{vmatrix}\\]\\[=\\bigl(0+0+0\\bigr)-\\bigl(-1+0+0\\bigr)\\]\\[=1\\neq0\\]<p>Existe \\(A^{-1}\\). Como \\(A\\cdot A=A^2=I\\), la inversa de \\(A\\) es la propia \\(A\\)<i class='n' data-t='why'>La inversa es la matriz que multiplicada por \\(A\\) da \\(I\\), y eso es justo lo que hace \\(A\\).</i>.</p><div class='res'>\\(A^{-1}=A=\\begin{pmatrix}0&0&1\\\\0&-1&0\\\\1&0&0\\end{pmatrix}\\)</div></div>"
    }
   ],
   "clasificacion": [
