  {
   "id": "matematicas-2018-septiembre-4",
   "n": 4,
   "num": 4,
   "bloque": "Opción A",
   "puntos": "2,5",
   "enunciado": {
    "intro": "Considera las rectas \\(r\\equiv\\dfrac{x+1}2=\\dfrac y1=\\dfrac{z+1}3\\) y \\(s\\equiv\\begin{cases}2x-3y=-5\\\\y-2z=-1\\end{cases}\\)",
    "apartados": [
     "(1 p.) Estudia y determina la posición relativa de \\(r\\) y \\(s\\).",
     "(1,5 p.) Calcula la distancia entre \\(r\\) y \\(s\\)."
    ]
   },
   "solucion": [
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado a",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>\\(r\\) pasa por \\(R(-1,0,-1)\\) con \\(\\vec d_r=(2,1,3)\\). Para \\(s\\) tomo \\(z=\\lambda\\): \\(y=-1+2\\lambda\\) y \\(2x=-5+3y=-8+6\\lambda\\iff x=-4+3\\lambda\\).</p>\\[r\\equiv\\begin{cases}x=-1+2t\\\\y=t\\\\z=-1+3t\\end{cases}\\qquad s\\equiv\\begin{cases}x=-4+3\\lambda\\\\y=-1+2\\lambda\\\\z=\\lambda\\end{cases}\\]<p>\\(s\\) pasa por \\(S(-4,-1,0)\\) con \\(\\vec d_s=(3,2,1)\\). Los directores no son proporcionales: las rectas se cortan o se cruzan. Con \\(\\overrightarrow{RS}=(-3,-1,1)\\) calculo el producto mixto por la regla de Sarrus<i class='n' data-t='th'>Regla de Sarrus: se suman los productos de la diagonal principal y de los dos triángulos con un lado paralelo a ella (en verde) y se restan los de la diagonal secundaria y sus dos triángulos (en rojo).<span style='display:block;margin:6px 0 0'><svg viewBox='0 0 206 106' width='100%' style='max-width:230px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif'><text x='0' y='30' font-size='20' font-weight='700' fill='#17a673'>+</text><text x='0' y='86' font-size='20' font-weight='700' fill='#e8487a'>−</text><polygon points='26,10 41,25 56,40' fill='#17a673' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='26' cy='10' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='41' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='26' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='25' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='56' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='26' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='40' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><polygon points='103,10 118,25 88,40' fill='#17a673' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='88' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='10' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='118' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='88' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='25' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='88' cy='40' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='103' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='180,10 150,25 165,40' fill='#17a673' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='150' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='10' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='150' cy='25' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='165' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='150' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='40' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='180' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='56,66 41,81 26,96' fill='#e8487a' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='26' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='66' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='26' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='81' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='56' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='26' cy='96' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='41' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='88,66 118,81 103,96' fill='#e8487a' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='88' cy='66' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='103' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='88' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='81' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='88' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='96' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='118' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='165,66 150,81 180,96' fill='#e8487a' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='150' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='66' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='180' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='150' cy='81' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='165' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='150' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='96' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/></svg></span></i><i class='n' data-t='th'>Si el producto mixto es 0, los tres vectores son coplanarios y las rectas se cortan; si no, se cruzan.</i>:</p>\\[[\\overrightarrow{RS},\\vec d_r,\\vec d_s]=\\begin{vmatrix}-3&-1&1\\\\2&1&3\\\\3&2&1\\end{vmatrix}\\]\\[=\\bigl(-3-9+4\\bigr)-\\bigl(3-18-2\\bigr)\\]\\[=9\\neq0\\]<div class='res'>Las rectas \\(r\\) y \\(s\\) se cruzan</div></div>"
    },
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado b",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>La distancia entre dos rectas que se cruzan es la longitud del segmento de su perpendicular común. Tomo \\(P(-1+2t,\\,t,\\,-1+3t)\\in r\\) y \\(Q(-4+3\\lambda,\\,-1+2\\lambda,\\,\\lambda)\\in s\\):</p>\\[\\overrightarrow{PQ}=(-3+3\\lambda-2t,\\ -1+2\\lambda-t,\\ 1+\\lambda-3t)\\]<p>\\(\\overrightarrow{PQ}\\) tiene que ser perpendicular a las dos rectas:</p>\\[\\overrightarrow{PQ}\\cdot\\vec d_r=0\\iff-4+11\\lambda-14t=0\\]\\[\\overrightarrow{PQ}\\cdot\\vec d_s=0\\iff-10+14\\lambda-11t=0\\]<p>De la primera, \\(\\lambda=\\dfrac{4+14t}{11}\\). Sustituyendo en la segunda: \\(56+196t-121t=110\\iff75t=54\\iff t=\\dfrac{18}{25}\\), y \\(\\lambda=\\dfrac{32}{25}\\).</p>\\[\\overrightarrow{PQ}=\\left(-\\frac{15}{25},\\,\\frac{21}{25},\\,\\frac3{25}\\right)=\\frac3{25}(-5,7,1)\\]\\[d(r,s)=|\\overrightarrow{PQ}|=\\frac3{25}\\sqrt{25+49+1}=\\frac3{25}\\cdot5\\sqrt3=\\frac{3\\sqrt3}5\\]<div class='f3d' data-f='{\"az\":81,\"el\":20,\"p\":[[\"line\",[-0.5,0.25,-0.25],[1.4,1.2,2.6],\"#2563eb\",2.2,false],[\"txt\",[1.4,1.2,2.6],\"r\",\"#2563eb\",6,0],[\"line\",[-1.6,0.6,0.8],[1.25,2.5,1.75],\"#2563eb\",2.2,false],[\"txt\",[1.25,2.5,1.75],\"s\",\"#2563eb\",6,0],[\"vec\",[0.9,0.95,1.85],[1.221,1.11,2.331],\"#16a34a\",\"d_r\",4,-4],[\"vec\",[0.5,2.0,1.5],[0.981,2.321,1.66],\"#16a34a\",\"d_s\",4,-4],[\"line\",[0.44,0.72,1.16],[-0.16,1.56,1.28],\"#16a34a\",2.0,true],[\"line\",[0.504,0.752,1.256],[0.435,0.849,1.27],\"#475569\",1.3,false],[\"line\",[0.435,0.849,1.27],[0.371,0.817,1.174],\"#475569\",1.3,false],[\"pt\",[0.44,0.72,1.16],\"P\",7,-6],[\"pt\",[-0.16,1.56,1.28],\"Q\",8,12]],\"ley\":[\"recta\",\"vector director\",\"puntos\"]}' style='overflow-x:auto'><svg viewBox='0 0 340 298' width='100%' style='max-width:440px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif' font-size='11' fill='currentColor'><defs><marker id='m18sa4n' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#dc2626'/></marker><marker id='m18sa4d' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#16a34a'/></marker><marker id='m18sa4g' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#64748b'/></marker><marker id='m18sa4r' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#2563eb'/></marker></defs><line x1='199.4' y1='244.4' x2='26.0' y2='18.0' stroke='#2563eb' stroke-width='2.2'/><text x='32.0' y='18.0' fill='#2563eb' font-weight='700' font-style='italic'>r</text><line x1='314.0' y1='151.3' x2='61.3' y2='141.4' stroke='#2563eb' stroke-width='2.2'/><text x='67.3' y='141.4' fill='#2563eb' font-weight='700' font-style='italic'>s</text><line x1='71.6' y1='77.6' x2='42.4' y2='39.4' stroke='#16a34a' stroke-width='2.4' marker-end='url(#m18sa4d)'/><text x='46.4' y='35.4' fill='#16a34a' font-weight='700'>d_r</text><line x1='127.8' y1='144.0' x2='85.1' y2='142.4' stroke='#16a34a' stroke-width='2.4' marker-end='url(#m18sa4d)'/><text x='89.1' y='138.4' fill='#16a34a' font-weight='700'>d_s</text><line x1='113.6' y1='132.4' x2='186.3' y2='146.3' stroke='#16a34a' stroke-width='2.0' stroke-dasharray='4 3'/><line x1='107.8' y1='124.8' x2='116.2' y2='126.4' stroke='#475569' stroke-width='1.3'/><line x1='116.2' y1='126.4' x2='122.0' y2='134.0' stroke='#475569' stroke-width='1.3'/><circle cx='113.6' cy='132.4' r='3.8' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='120.6' y='126.4' font-weight='700'>P</text><circle cx='186.3' cy='146.3' r='3.8' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='194.3' y='158.3' font-weight='700'>Q</text><line x1='24' y1='268' x2='8.2' y2='268.9' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='-0.3' y='273.2' fill='#64748b' font-size='10'>x</text><line x1='24' y1='268' x2='26.5' y2='273.4' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='24.4' y='279.3' fill='#64748b' font-size='10'>y</text><line x1='24' y1='268' x2='24.0' y2='253.0' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='21.0' y='251.7' fill='#64748b' font-size='10'>z</text><g transform='translate(56.0,290)'><line x1='0' y1='-4' x2='14' y2='-4' stroke='#2563eb' stroke-width='2'/><text x='18' y='0' font-size='10'>recta</text></g><g transform='translate(106.5,290)'><line x1='0' y1='-4' x2='14' y2='-4' stroke='#16a34a' stroke-width='2.4'/><text x='18' y='0' font-size='10'>vector director</text></g><g transform='translate(210.0,290)'><circle cx='6' cy='-4' r='3.8' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='18' y='0' font-size='10'>puntos</text></g></svg><p class='mut' style='font-size:.8rem;margin:.2rem 0;text-align:center'>Figura interactiva: arrástrala para girarla en 3D.</p></div><div class='res'>\\(d(r,s)=\\dfrac{3\\sqrt3}5\\approx1{,}0392\\) unidades</div><i class='n' data-t='tp'>Comprobación con la fórmula \\(d=\\frac{|[\\overrightarrow{RS},\\vec d_r,\\vec d_s]|}{|\\vec d_r\\times\\vec d_s|}=\\frac9{|(-5,7,1)|}=\\frac9{5\\sqrt3}=\\frac{3\\sqrt3}5\\) ✓.</i></div>"
    }
