  {
   "id": "matematicas-2018-septiembre-6",
   "n": 6,
   "num": 2,
   "bloque": "Opción B",
   "puntos": "2,5",
   "enunciado": {
    "intro": "Considera la función \\(f:\\mathbb R\\to\\mathbb R\\) definida por \\(f(x)=e^{-2x}\\).",
    "apartados": [
     "(0,75 p.) Determina el punto de la gráfica de \\(f\\) en el que la recta tangente es \\(y=-2ex\\).",
     "(0,5 p.) Esboza el recinto limitado por la gráfica de \\(f\\), la recta \\(y=-2ex\\) y el eje de ordenadas.",
     "(1,25 p.) Calcula el área del recinto descrito en el apartado anterior."
    ]
   },
   "solucion": [
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado a",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>En el punto de tangencia \\(x_0\\), la pendiente de la tangente es \\(f'(x_0)=-2e^{-2x_0}\\) y tiene que valer \\(-2e\\):</p>\\[-2e^{-2x_0}=-2e\\iff e^{-2x_0}=e^1\\iff-2x_0=1\\iff x_0=-\\frac12\\]<p>\\(f\\left(-\\frac12\\right)=e\\). La tangente en ese punto es \\(y-e=-2e\\left(x+\\frac12\\right)\\iff y=-2ex\\) ✓: coincide con la recta dada.</p><div class='res'>El punto es \\(\\left(-\\dfrac12,\\,e\\right)\\)</div></div>"
    },
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado b",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>\\(f\\) es decreciente y convexa (\\(f''(x)=4e^{-2x}\\gt0\\)), así que su gráfica queda por encima de la tangente. El recinto está entre \\(x=-\\frac12\\) (punto de tangencia) y \\(x=0\\) (eje de ordenadas), con \\(f\\) por encima y la recta por debajo.</p><div style='overflow-x:auto'><svg viewBox='0 0 300 250' width='100%' style='max-width:380px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif' font-size='11' fill='currentColor'><polygon points='102.7,62.1 104.2,65.3 105.7,68.4 107.2,71.5 108.6,74.4 110.1,77.3 111.6,80.2 113.1,82.9 114.5,85.6 116.0,88.2 117.5,90.8 119.0,93.3 120.5,95.7 121.9,98.1 123.4,100.4 124.9,102.7 126.4,104.9 127.8,107.0 129.3,109.1 130.8,111.1 132.3,113.1 133.8,115.1 135.2,117.0 136.7,118.8 138.2,120.6 139.7,122.4 141.1,124.1 142.6,125.8 144.1,127.4 145.6,129.0 147.0,130.5 148.5,132.0 150.0,133.5 151.5,135.0 153.0,136.4 154.4,137.7 155.9,139.1 157.4,140.4 158.9,141.6 160.3,142.9 161.8,144.1 161.8,191.8 160.3,188.6 158.9,185.3 157.4,182.1 155.9,178.8 154.4,175.6 153.0,172.4 151.5,169.1 150.0,165.9 148.5,162.6 147.0,159.4 145.6,156.1 144.1,152.9 142.6,149.7 141.1,146.4 139.7,143.2 138.2,139.9 136.7,136.7 135.2,133.4 133.8,130.2 132.3,127.0 130.8,123.7 129.3,120.5 127.8,117.2 126.4,114.0 124.9,110.7 123.4,107.5 121.9,104.2 120.5,101.0 119.0,97.8 117.5,94.5 116.0,91.3 114.5,88.0 113.1,84.8 111.6,81.5 110.1,78.3 108.6,75.1 107.2,71.8 105.7,68.6 104.2,65.3 102.7,62.1' fill='#b9a4f5' fill-opacity='.55'/><polyline points='88.5,26.9 92.4,37.2 96.2,46.9 100.0,56.0 103.9,64.5 107.7,72.5 111.5,80.0 115.3,87.0 119.2,93.6 123.0,99.8 126.8,105.5 130.7,111.0 134.5,116.0 138.3,120.8 142.2,125.2 146.0,129.4 149.8,133.3 153.6,137.0 157.5,140.4 161.3,143.7 165.1,146.7 169.0,149.5 172.8,152.2 176.6,154.7 180.4,157.0 184.3,159.2 188.1,161.2 191.9,163.1 195.8,164.9 199.6,166.6 203.4,168.2 207.2,169.7 211.1,171.1 214.9,172.4 218.7,173.6 222.6,174.7 226.4,175.8 230.2,176.8 234.1,177.8 237.9,178.6 241.7,179.5 245.5,180.2 249.4,181.0 253.2,181.7 257.0,182.3 260.9,182.9 264.7,183.4 268.5,184.0 272.3,184.5 276.2,184.9 280.0,185.4' fill='none' stroke='#2f6df0' stroke-width='2'/><polyline points='83.8,20.6 115.7,90.6 147.6,160.7 179.5,230.7' fill='none' stroke='#f0a30a' stroke-width='2'/><circle cx='102.7' cy='62.1' r='3.5' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='36.7' y='58.1'>(−1/2, e)</text><circle cx='161.8' cy='144.1' r='3.5' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='167.8' y='140.1'>(0,1)</text><text x='197.3' y='144.1' fill='#2f6df0' font-size='10'>f(x) = e^(−2x)</text><text x='25.9' y='29.5' fill='#f0a30a' font-size='10'>y = −2ex</text><g stroke='currentColor' fill='none' stroke-width='1.2'><path d='M12.0 191.8H294.0M161.8 244.0V8.0'/></g><line x1='43.6' y1='188.8' x2='43.6' y2='194.8' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='40.6' y='205.8' font-size='10'>-1</text><line x1='102.7' y1='188.8' x2='102.7' y2='194.8' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='99.7' y='205.8' font-size='10'>-0.5</text><line x1='220.9' y1='188.8' x2='220.9' y2='194.8' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='217.9' y='205.8' font-size='10'>0.5</text><line x1='158.8' y1='144.1' x2='164.8' y2='144.1' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='145.8' y='148.1' font-size='10'>1</text><line x1='158.8' y1='96.4' x2='164.8' y2='96.4' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='145.8' y='100.4' font-size='10'>2</text><line x1='158.8' y1='48.6' x2='164.8' y2='48.6' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='145.8' y='52.6' font-size='10'>3</text></svg></div></div>"
    },
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado c",
     "html": "<div class='ex'>\\[A=\\int_{-1/2}^0\\bigl(e^{-2x}+2ex\\bigr)dx=\\Bigl[-\\frac{e^{-2x}}2+ex^2\\Bigr]_{-1/2}^0\\]\\[A=\\left(-\\frac12+0\\right)-\\left(-\\frac e2+\\frac e4\\right)=-\\frac12+\\frac e4=\\frac{e-2}4\\]<div class='res'>Área \\(=\\dfrac{e-2}4\\approx0{,}1796\\ u^2\\)</div></div>"
    }
   ],
   "clasificacion": [
