  {
   "id": "matematicas-2018-septiembre-8",
   "n": 8,
   "num": 4,
   "bloque": "Opción B",
   "puntos": "2,5",
   "enunciado": {
    "intro": "Considera las rectas \\(r\\equiv\\dfrac{x-1}2=\\dfrac{y+1}m=z\\) y \\(s\\equiv\\begin{cases}x+nz=-2\\\\y-z=-3\\end{cases}\\)",
    "apartados": [
     "(1,5 p.) Halla los valores de \\(m\\) y \\(n\\) para los que \\(r\\) y \\(s\\) se cortan perpendicularmente.",
     "(1 p.) Para \\(m=3\\) y \\(n=1\\), calcula la ecuación general del plano que contiene a \\(r\\) y a \\(s\\)."
    ]
   },
   "solucion": [
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado a",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>\\(r\\) pasa por \\(R(1,-1,0)\\) con \\(\\vec d_r=(2,m,1)\\). Para \\(s\\) tomo \\(z=\\lambda\\): \\(x=-2-n\\lambda\\), \\(y=-3+\\lambda\\); pasa por \\(S(-2,-3,0)\\) con \\(\\vec d_s=(-n,1,1)\\).</p><p><b>Perpendiculares:</b> \\(\\vec d_r\\cdot\\vec d_s=0\\iff-2n+m+1=0\\iff m=2n-1\\).</p><p><b>Se cortan:</b> los vectores \\(\\overrightarrow{RS}=(-3,-2,0)\\), \\(\\vec d_r\\) y \\(\\vec d_s\\) tienen que ser coplanarios (producto mixto nulo)<i class='n' data-t='th'>Dos rectas no paralelas se cortan si y solo si \\([\\overrightarrow{RS},\\vec d_r,\\vec d_s]=0\\).</i>. Lo calculo por la regla de Sarrus<i class='n' data-t='th'>Regla de Sarrus: se suman los productos de la diagonal principal y de los dos triángulos con un lado paralelo a ella (en verde) y se restan los de la diagonal secundaria y sus dos triángulos (en rojo).<span style='display:block;margin:6px 0 0'><svg viewBox='0 0 206 106' width='100%' style='max-width:230px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif'><text x='0' y='30' font-size='20' font-weight='700' fill='#17a673'>+</text><text x='0' y='86' font-size='20' font-weight='700' fill='#e8487a'>−</text><polygon points='26,10 41,25 56,40' fill='#17a673' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='26' cy='10' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='41' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='26' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='25' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='56' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='26' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='40' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><polygon points='103,10 118,25 88,40' fill='#17a673' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='88' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='10' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='118' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='88' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='25' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='88' cy='40' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='103' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='180,10 150,25 165,40' fill='#17a673' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='150' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='10' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='150' cy='25' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='165' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='150' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='40' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='180' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='56,66 41,81 26,96' fill='#e8487a' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='26' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='66' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='26' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='81' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='56' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='26' cy='96' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='41' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='88,66 118,81 103,96' fill='#e8487a' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='88' cy='66' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='103' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='88' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='81' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='88' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='96' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='118' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='165,66 150,81 180,96' fill='#e8487a' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='150' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='66' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='180' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='150' cy='81' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='165' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='150' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='96' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/></svg></span></i>:</p>\\[[\\overrightarrow{RS},\\vec d_r,\\vec d_s]=\\begin{vmatrix}-3&-2&0\\\\2&m&1\\\\-n&1&1\\end{vmatrix}\\]\\[=\\bigl(- 3 m+2 n+0\\bigr)-\\bigl(0-3-4\\bigr)\\]\\[=-3m+2n+7\\]\\[-3m+2n+7=0\\]<p>Sustituyo \\(m=2n-1\\): \\(-6n+3+2n+7=0\\iff n=\\dfrac52\\), y \\(m=4\\). Con estos valores \\(\\vec d_r=(2,4,1)\\) y \\(\\vec d_s=\\left(-\\frac52,1,1\\right)\\) no son proporcionales, así que las rectas se cortan (en el punto \\(\\left(-\\frac13,-\\frac{11}3,-\\frac23\\right)\\)).</p><div class='res'>\\(m=4,\\ n=\\dfrac52\\)</div></div>"
    },
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado b",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>Con \\(m=3\\) y \\(n=1\\): \\(\\vec d_r=(2,3,1)\\), \\(\\vec d_s=(-1,1,1)\\) y el producto mixto vale \\(-9+2+7=0\\): las rectas se cortan y determinan un plano. Su vector normal es perpendicular a los dos directores:</p>\\[\\vec n=\\vec d_r\\times\\vec d_s=\\begin{vmatrix}\\vec i&\\vec j&\\vec k\\\\2&3&1\\\\-1&1&1\\end{vmatrix}=(2,\\,-3,\\,5)\\]<p>El plano es de la forma \\(2x-3y+5z+D=0\\) y como contiene a \\(R(1,-1,0)\\): \\(2+3+D=0\\iff D=-5\\).</p><div class='f3d' data-f='{\"az\":0,\"el\":22,\"p\":[[\"poly\",[[3.191,2.615,1.292],[-3.41,-1.786,1.292],[-2.191,-3.615,-0.292],[4.41,0.786,-0.292]],\"#8b5cf6\",\"#7c3aed\"],[\"txt\",[-2.191,-3.615,-0.292],\"π\",\"#7c3aed\",4,0],[\"line\",[-1.0,-4.0,-1.0],[3.4,2.6,1.2],\"#2563eb\",2.2,false],[\"txt\",[3.4,2.6,1.2],\"r\",\"#2563eb\",6,0],[\"line\",[-1.0,-4.0,-1.0],[-4.2,-0.8,2.2],\"#2563eb\",2.2,false],[\"txt\",[-4.2,-0.8,2.2],\"s\",\"#2563eb\",6,0],[\"vec\",[0,-1.5,0.5],[0.324,-1.987,1.311],\"#dc2626\",\"n\",4,-4],[\"pt\",[1,-1,0],\"R\",7,-6],[\"pt\",[-2,-3,0],\"S\",7,-6]],\"ley\":[\"plano\",\"recta\",\"vector normal\",\"puntos\"]}' style='overflow-x:auto'><svg viewBox='0 0 340 300' width='100%' style='max-width:440px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif' font-size='11' fill='currentColor'><defs><marker id='m18sb4n' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#dc2626'/></marker><marker id='m18sb4d' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#16a34a'/></marker><marker id='m18sb4g' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#64748b'/></marker><marker id='m18sb4r' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#2563eb'/></marker></defs><polygon points='298.4,166.7 117.2,64.8 41.9,144.2 223.1,246.0' fill='#8b5cf6' fill-opacity='.26' stroke='#7c3aed' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='45.9' y='144.2' fill='#7c3aed' font-weight='700' font-style='italic'>π</text><line x1='26.0' y1='189.6' x2='297.8' y2='173.4' stroke='#2563eb' stroke-width='2.2'/><text x='303.8' y='173.4' fill='#2563eb' font-weight='700' font-style='italic'>r</text><line x1='26.0' y1='189.6' x2='157.8' y2='18.0' stroke='#2563eb' stroke-width='2.2'/><text x='163.8' y='18.0' fill='#2563eb' font-weight='700' font-style='italic'>s</text><line x1='129.0' y1='147.7' x2='108.9' y2='121.7' stroke='#dc2626' stroke-width='2.4' marker-end='url(#m18sb4n)'/><text x='112.9' y='117.7' fill='#dc2626' font-weight='700'>n</text><circle cx='149.5' cy='182.2' r='3.8' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='156.5' y='176.2' font-weight='700'>R</text><circle cx='67.2' cy='135.9' r='3.8' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='74.2' y='129.9' font-weight='700'>S</text><line x1='24' y1='270' x2='24.0' y2='276.0' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='21.0' y='282.1' fill='#64748b' font-size='10'>x</text><line x1='24' y1='270' x2='40.0' y2='270.0' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='42.6' y='274.0' fill='#64748b' font-size='10'>y</text><line x1='24' y1='270' x2='24.0' y2='255.2' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='21.0' y='254.0' fill='#64748b' font-size='10'>z</text><g transform='translate(56.0,292)'><rect x='0' y='-8' width='12' height='9' fill='#8b5cf6' fill-opacity='.4' stroke='#7c3aed'/><text x='18' y='0' font-size='10'>plano</text></g><g transform='translate(106.5,292)'><line x1='0' y1='-4' x2='14' y2='-4' stroke='#2563eb' stroke-width='2'/><text x='18' y='0' font-size='10'>recta</text></g><g transform='translate(157.0,292)'><line x1='0' y1='-4' x2='14' y2='-4' stroke='#dc2626' stroke-width='2.4'/><text x='18' y='0' font-size='10'>vector normal</text></g><g transform='translate(249.9,292)'><circle cx='6' cy='-4' r='3.8' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='18' y='0' font-size='10'>puntos</text></g></svg><p class='mut' style='font-size:.8rem;margin:.2rem 0;text-align:center'>Figura interactiva: arrástrala para girarla en 3D.</p></div><div class='res'>\\(\\pi\\equiv2x-3y+5z-5=0\\)</div><i class='n' data-t='tp'>Comprobación: \\(S(-2,-3,0)\\): \\(-4+9-5=0\\) ✓.</i></div>"
    }
